Windows Registry Editor Version 5.00

; Liga 17: give the video card 60 s instead of 2 s before Windows resets it ("GPU crashed or D3D device removed").
; Restart the computer after applying. To undo, run gpu_timeout_default.reg.
[HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\SYSTEM\CurrentControlSet\Control\GraphicsDrivers]
"TdrDelay"=dword:0000003c
"TdrDdiDelay"=dword:0000003c
